On isolated representative data, back up existing config/auth, import to explicit owner, start new runtime, compare effective tools/endpoints, apply a change, restart, restore backup and reverse migration. Verify intended admin edge routes without publishing broader access. Acceptance: timed evidence and rollback checkpoints recorded; no irreversible schema change without recovery path; actual production action follows authorization at execution time. Implementation/local evidence: docs/specs/remote-configuration-acceptance.md. Production and native-host verification remain separate release gates.
